		[183]={ skill_id=103304, skill_levelup_data={
		[2731]={ skill_lv=1, hero_rank=2, cost_item={{2451,8}}, need_star=0, pay_tid=1, pay_num=1800, desc="Zephyrine absorbs Blessing energy and enters <color=#ffb136>Star-Calling Spirit</color> form, greatly enhancing abilities (ATK +50%, energy gain +100%, immune to control and cannot be interrupted). Duration unlimited. Does not exit form upon death. If already in <color=#ffb136>Star-Calling Spirit</color> form, Energy Burst evolves — Zephyrine deals Quantum damage to <color=#ffb136>all enemies</color>, equal to <color=#18ec68>127</color>% of ATK + <color=#18ec68>60</color>. On first hit, applies <color=#ffb136>Golden Thread Lock</color> to the primary target (the target's next 3 skill damage instances cannot be absorbed by shields or barriers and cannot trigger damage sharing), lasting 2 turns. <color=#ffb136>Golden Thread Lock</color> cannot be dispelled. After the evolved Energy Burst resolves, exits <color=#ffb136>Star-Calling Spirit</color> form and applies 1 stack of <color=#ffb136>Golden Plume Blessing</color> to all allies", skill_levelup_des="" },
